<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl short year eps 18 ats.</title>
<headline>VA Stahl short year eps 18 ats.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian steelmaker VA Stahl's earnings per share dropped to 18 schillings in the three months to March 31 from 50 schillings in 1996, according to the OeVFA association of Austrian analysts.</p>
<p>In a statement OEVFA said VA Stahl's cash earnings per share fell to 26 schillings from 92 while book value per share rose to 430 schillings from 413.</p>
<p>VA Stahl, which has switched its financial year to end on March 31 instead of December 31, earlier presented its results for the &quot;short year&quot; January to March 1997.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
